    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Murphy and Sons is proud to present this excellent Excellent 5-Bedroom , 4-bathroom detached family home For Sale by Private Treaty.\r\nOffering 184.sq.metres of bright, versatile living space, this property stands on 0.28 hectares/c. 0.69 acre site on the highly sought-after Oakfield Road.\r\n\r\nSituated on Oakfield Road, the location is highly coveted for its unbeatable convenience.  You are just a short stroll form the vibrant heart of Sligo Town Centre, while staying directly convenient to premium local amenities, including top-rated primary and secondary schools, local shops, churches, and sporting facilities.\r\n\r\nAs you step inside, the welcoming hallway immediately sets a  tone of quality and warmth, showcasing beautiful, premium canadian maple wood flooring, throughout the ground floor spaces.\r\n\r\nThe thoughtfully designed layout provides the ideal balance for modern living, offering spacious reception room, a generous kitchen area, and comfortable bedroom accommodation across all its well-proportioned floors."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Ground Floor - \r\n\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall - \r\nCanadian Maple wood floor.\r\n\r\nSitting Room - 5.13m x 4.1m \r\nCanadian Maple wood floor\nFeature open fireplace with cast iron hearth\nDecorative coving to ceiling\nTV Point\r\n\r\nLiving/Dining/Kitchen - 8.7m x 3.95m \r\nCanadian Maple wood floor to living area. \nSolid fuel stove.\nDecorative coving to ceiling\nTiled floor to kitchen and dining area\nTiled between units.\nFully fitted kitchen with breakfast bar, ample units and counter space\nIntegrated dishwasher, electric oven, hob and extractor fan.\r\n\r\nUtility Room - 2.69m x 1.94m \r\nTiled floor and between units\nFully fitted floor and wall units.\nPlumbed for washing machine\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 4.08m x 3.87m \r\nLarge double room with carpet floor\nLarge window with views\nDecorative coving to ceiling\n                   \n\r\n\r\nWalk in Wardrobe - 3.02m x 2.7m \r\nCarpet Floor\nBuilt in wardrobe units\r\n\r\nEnsuite - 2.87m x 1.08m \r\nFully tiled floor to ceiling\nWC  & WHB\nShower (electric)\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 2.98m x 2.74m \r\nDouble room with carpet floor\r\n\r\nFirst Floor - \r\n\r\n\r\nLanding - \r\nSolid wood floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 4.69m x 3.33m \r\nDouble room with solid wood floor.\nSkylights\nBuilt in shelving and wardrobes\r\n\r\nEnsuite - 2.58m x 1.33m \r\nFully tiled floor to ceiling.\nWC & WHB\nElectric Shower\r\n\r\nBedroom 4/Office - 4.74m x 2.24m \r\nSingle room with solid wood floor\nBuilt in wardrobe and units\nSkylights\r\n\r\nEnsuite - 2.31m x 1.04m \r\nFully tiled floor to ceiling\nWC & WHB\nElectric shower\r\n\r\nBedroom 5 - 3.91m x 2.3m \r\nSingle room \nSolid wood floor\nSkylight\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Oil Fired Central Heating\r\nDouble glazed windows\r\nCanadian Maple wood flooring to ground floor\r\nFully alarmed\r\nLarge private site with ample parking & outdoor space\r\nMature surrounding gardens & Beautiful scenic views\r\nShort drive to Sligo Town, Finisklin & Strandhill\r\nClose to wide range of amenities including schools, shops, sporting facilities"
      },
